From 3dccacccfa303506468cd2c4406e7d08561294d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 02:34:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Audit LP64 primitives and packed persistent records

Refresh moving heap sources, bound integer/record conversions, zero-pad partial payloads, and preserve the RAM erased-tail invariant after compaction. Offer the same integer/JSON misc core without libm in the minimal profile, and document compact absolute handles and legacy-board compatibility.

Co-authored-by: Shelley <shelley@exe.dev>
